flowchart TD
  Good[Successful CI snapshot] --> Compare[Environment diff]
  Fail[Failing command] --> Log[Bounded log signature]
  Fail --> Provenance[Direct interpreter provenance]
  Fail --> Snapshot[Failing environment snapshot]
  Snapshot --> Compare
  Compare --> Diagnose[Evidence-gated diagnosis]
  Log --> Diagnose
  Provenance --> Diagnose
  Diagnose --> JSON[Diagnostic JSON]
  JSON --> Dossier[Auditable incident Markdown]
  JSON --> Reports[CI annotations and code-quality report]
